{'symbol': 'RE', 'date': '2022-05-23 07:30:00', 'title': 'MATTHEW ROHRMANN JOINS EVEREST AS HEAD OF INVESTOR RELATIONS', 'text': "HAMILTON, BERMUDA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EVEREST RE GROUP, LTD. (“EVEREST” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: RE) ANNOUNCED THAT MATTHEW ROHRMANN HAS JOINED THE COMPANY AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, HEAD OF INVESTOR RELATIONS REPORTING DIRECTLY TO EVEREST EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT & CFO MARK KOCIANCIC. HE SUCCEEDS JON LEVENSON. MATT WILL BE FOCUSED ON DEEPENING EVEREST'S ENGAGEMENT WITH THE FINANCIAL COMMUNITY, STRATEGIC PLANNING AND MARKET ANALYSIS, AND WILL ALSO BE RESPONSIBLE FOR RATINGS AGENCY INTERACTIONS"}